        "html": "<section class=\"pp-section pp-section--with-photo\">\n      <div class=\"pp-container\">\n        <div class=\"pp-section-title\">\n          <span class=\"pp-eyebrow\" data-i18n=\"hero.eyebrow\">Pet Care OEM/ODM Factory</span>\n          <h2 data-i18n=\"stats.label1\">Third-party verified performance</h2>\n          <p>Every number below comes from an independent lab report. View them all in <a href=\"/certifications.html\">Certifications</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"pp-ring-row\">\n          <div class=\"pp-ring pp-ring--teal\" data-value=\"94.2\" data-unit=\"%\" data-max=\"100\">\n            <svg class=\"pp-ring__svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 180\">\n              <circle class=\"pp-ring__bg\" cx=\"90\" cy=\"90\" r=\"70\"/>\n              <circle class=\"pp-ring__fg\" cx=\"90\" cy=\"90\" r=\"70\" stroke-dasharray=\"439.8\" stroke-dashoffset=\"439.8\"/>\n            </svg>\n            <div class=\"pp-ring__value\">0%</div>\n            <div class=\"pp-ring__label\" data-i18n=\"stats.label1\">Ammonia removal</div>\n            <div class=\"pp-ring__label\" style=\"font-size: var(--pp-text-xs); color: var(--pp-ink-400);\" data-i18n=\"stats.sub1\">Report NACCYH25014722</div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"pp-ring pp-ring--amber\" data-value=\"99.999\" data-unit=\"%\" data-max=\"100\">\n            <svg class=\"pp-ring__svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 180\">\n              <circle class=\"pp-ring__bg\" cx=\"90\" cy=\"90\" r=\"70\"/>\n              <circle class=\"pp-ring__fg\" cx=\"90\" cy=\"90\" r=\"70\" stroke-dasharray=\"439.8\" stroke-dashoffset=\"439.8\"/>\n            </svg>\n            <div class=\"pp-ring__value\">0%</div>\n            <div class=\"pp-ring__label\" data-i18n=\"stats.label2\">Pathogen kill rate</div>\n            <div class=\"pp-ring__label\" style=\"font-size: var(--pp-text-xs); color: var(--pp-ink-400);\" data-i18n=\"stats.sub2\">3 strains verified</div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"pp-ring pp-ring--teal\" data-value=\"100\" data-unit=\"%\" data-max=\"100\">\n            <svg class=\"pp-ring__svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 180\">\n              <circle class=\"pp-ring__bg\" cx=\"90\" cy=\"90\" r=\"70\"/>\n              <circle class=\"pp-ring__fg\" cx=\"90\" cy=\"90\" r=\"70\" stroke-dasharray=\"439.8\" stroke-dashoffset=\"439.8\"/>\n            </svg>\n            <div class=\"pp-ring__value\">0%</div>\n            <div class=\"pp-ring__label\" data-i18n=\"stats.label3\">Natural formulas</div>\n            <div class=\"pp-ring__label\" style=\"font-size: var(--pp-text-xs); color: var(--pp-ink-400);\" data-i18n=\"stats.sub3\">Plant-based ingredients</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
