        "sub": null,
        "html": "<section class=\"pp-section\">\n      <div class=\"pp-container\">\n        <div class=\"pp-section-title\">\n          <span class=\"pp-eyebrow\">Product Lines</span>\n          <h2 data-i18n=\"categories.title\">Four product lines, ready to ship</h2>\n          <p data-i18n=\"categories.subtitle\">Each line tested, certified, and built for global B2B partners</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"pp-grid pp-grid--4\">\n          <a class=\"pp-cat-card\" href=\"/products/deodorizing-disinfecting.html\">\n            <span class=\"pp-cat-card__count\">5 SKUs</span>\n            <div class=\"pp-cat-card__icon\">\n              <img src=\"/assets/img/hero/cat-five-cute.jpg\" alt=\"Pet deodorizing and disinfecting\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n            </div>\n            <h3 class=\"pp-cat-card__title\" data-i18n=\"categories.deodorizing-disinfecting.name\">Deodorizing &amp; Disinfecting</h3>\n            <p class=\"pp-cat-card__desc\" data-i18n=\"categories.deodorizing-disinfecting.desc\">Enzyme-powered deodorizers and chlorine-dioxide disinfectants.</p>\n            <span class=\"pp-cat-card__link\" data-i18n=\"categories.explore\">Explore</span>\n          </a>\n\n          <a class=\"pp-cat-card\" href=\"/products/grooming-care.html\">\n            <span class=\"pp-cat-card__count\">7 SKUs</span>\n            <div class=\"pp-cat-card__icon\">\n              <img src=\"/assets/img/hero/pet-cute.jpg\" alt=\"Pet grooming and care\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n            </div>\n            <h3 class=\"pp-cat-card__title\" data-i18n=\"categories.grooming-care.name\">Grooming &amp; Care</h3>\n            <p class=\"pp-cat-card__desc\" data-i18n=\"categories.grooming-care.desc\">Camellia-based shampoos, foams, gels, dental and ear care.</p>\n            <span class=\"pp-cat-card__link\" data-i18n=\"categories.explore\">Explore</span>\n          </a>\n\n          <a class=\"pp-cat-card\" href=\"/products/outdoor-protection.html\">\n            <span class=\"pp-cat-card__count\">2 SKUs</span>\n            <div class=\"pp-cat-card__icon\">\n              <img src=\"/assets/img/hero/cat-outdoor-warm.jpg\" alt=\"Outdoor protection\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n            </div>\n            <h3 class=\"pp-cat-card__title\" data-i18n=\"categories.outdoor-protection.name\">Outdoor Protection</h3>\n            <p class=\"pp-cat-card__desc\" data-i18n=\"categories.outdoor-protection.desc\">Natural plant-based insect repellent with nano-silver.</p>\n            <span class=\"pp-cat-card__link\" data-i18n=\"categories.explore\">Explore</span>\n          </a>\n\n          <a class=\"pp-cat-card\" href=\"/products/pet-nutrition.html\">\n            <span class=\"pp-cat-card__count\">2 SKUs</span>\n            <div class=\"pp-cat-card__icon\">\n              <img src=\"/assets/img/hero/cat-indoor.jpg\" alt=\"Pet nutrition\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n            </div>\n            <h3 class=\"pp-cat-card__title\" data-i18n=\"categories.pet-nutrition.name\">Pet Nutrition</h3>\n            <p class=\"pp-cat-card__desc\" data-i18n=\"categories.pet-nutrition.desc\">Triple-encapsulated probiotics and IgG colostrum supplements.</p>\n            <span class=\"pp-cat-card__link\" data-i18n=\"categories.explore\">Explore</span>\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
